### Tested versions

Linux: v4.3.stable.mono.official [77dcf97d8]
Linux: v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]

A few conditions for me:
Linux Mint with custom Kernel installation and really new Mesa Drivers (provided in the System information)
To be able to run an AMD RX 9070.
This issue will most probably not exist on Windows, as there are functioning C# Compositor Effects there.
I am sadly not able to test it with an Nvidia Graphics card.

Also tested on another Linux Mint Machine with normal kernel installation and an RX 6700xt with the same driver setup. Also happens on that system.

